00 mb-16","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"There are thousands of Sanskrit mantras. Each tradition has its prescribed texts, its lineage-specific syllables, its Beeja mantras and Deity mantras and path-specific invocations. Faced with this abundance, most seekers either pick something arbitrarily, or freeze in indecision and pick nothing."}],"$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e","$L2f","$L30","$L31","$L32","$L33","$L34","$L35","$L36","$L37","$L38","$L39"]}],"$L3a","$L3b","$L3c"]}]}]
