42:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Yes. The Gayatri Mantra has been traditionally taught to children at the sacred thread ceremony (Upanayana). Simple mantras like Om Namah Shivaya are suitable for all ages."}]
